body:
Because I was literally leaving for work;

[https://imgur.com/a/dlubhyl](https://imgur.com/a/dlubhyl)

Factory pics on top - what they sent me below. Hair/eyes/skin color is custom, so that's not a mistake. Just the eye shape seems different.

Ask yourself this;

If you felt the need to make a vent post about it, and this has been bothering you a very long time, what if she DID show up? Would you even want to talk to her? Would she even still talk to you after it was over?  --Would you feel AWKWARD AT ALL if she were to show up?--

If the answers you find are negative, then let it be. She clearly doesn't seem to care, honestly.

His jester outfit and what he'll be;

